# SDD artifacts under openspec/changes/ ARE tracked by default — they are the
# shared record of a change and belong in its PR. The paths below are the
# exception: local scratch from changes that were never opened, listed one by
# one rather than as a wildcard precisely so the default stays "tracked".
# Adding a new change? Do nothing; it gets committed like the rest.
openspec/changes/design-token-consolidation/
openspec/changes/export-builder/
openspec/changes/sub-pm-bulk-assignment/
openspec/changes/ml-bot-resizable-columns/verify-report.md
